Package: vox-voice-paste
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Vox Voice Paste Maintainers <maintainers@example.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-pyside6.qtgui, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-numpy, python3-keyring, python3-platformdirs, python3-pydantic, python3-sounddevice, python3-websockets, python3-tomli-w, libportaudio2, wl-clipboard | xclip | xsel, libnotify-bin
Description: Ubuntu desktop voice dictation helper
 Vox Voice Paste opens a small recorder, transcribes speech, copies the final
 transcript to the clipboard, and lets the user paste it manually.
